{"id":"wb-6-743","name":"秀山古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"秀山古建筑群","text":"秀山古建筑群位于中国云南省玉溪市通海县秀山镇南的秀山公园，大理国时即已在山上立庙祭祀，元、明、清屡经增修重建，始成如今格局。秀山古建筑群主要包括：涌金寺、清凉台、玉皇阁、普光寺、土主庙、万寿宫、白龙寺、通海文庙、青龙庵，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A7%80%E5%B1%B1%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":91179310,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91179310","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/61e0d1c8a4bff967f39b19dc.jpg","title":"Xiu_Tonghai.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xiu_Tonghai.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/Xiu_Tonghai.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Xin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​通海秀山，金顶寺","width":320,"height":213}}